    "name": "A Place for Every Citizen",
    "type": "data_log",
    "body": "A PLACE FOR EVERY CITIZEN\nThe Public Citizenship Initiative\n\nThe Federation welcomes applications from all residents seeking lawful integration, without regard to condition or origin.\n\nSuccessful applicants receive:\n · assigned housing within a designated community\n · assigned labour suited to their capability\n · one daily meal\n · access to Federation medical review for registered dependents\n\nAll applicants complete a six-week Rehabilitation Orientation. Attendance is mandatory and recorded.\n\nOur helpers are the backbone of the districts they serve. Ask anyone who has been served by an uncle or an auntie of the Initiative — they will tell you what dignity through duty looks like.\n\nThe Federation does not ask where you have been.\nThe Federation asks only where you are going.\n\nEnquire at any Federation post. Bring documentation.\nBring nothing else.",
