    "name": "Conditions of Admission",
    "type": "data_log",
    "body": "THE GRAND LIBRARY\nBandar Bulat — the Round City\nCONDITIONS OF ADMISSION\n\nAdmission is granted to any person who comes to read. This has never been restricted, in any season, to any people, and it will not be.\n\nYou may not bring fire.\nYou may not bring water in an open vessel.\nYou may not bring any weapon past the second gate, and the second gate is not a matter for discussion with the men who keep it.\n\nYou may copy any text by hand, for as long as you like, and take the copy with you when you go.\nYou may not remove any original. There is no appeal, no exception, and no price.\n\nScribes are available to those who cannot write. There is no charge for this. Do not offer one.\n\nA note for travellers who have come a long way to find us:\n\nThe Library is older than the walls around it. The walls were built because of the Library, and not the other way about. Remember that, if you are ever asked to choose between the two.",
