    "name": "Night Watch — Edge Post",
    "type": "data_log",
    "body": "NIGHT WATCH — KAMPUNG EDGE POST\nEntries kept by rotation. Keep them short.\n\nNight 4 — Quiet.\n\nNight 5 — Hamid heard his mother. His mother died at Kulim, eleven years ago, and he knows that, and he still went forty steps toward the treeline before the two of us got him down. He has no memory of standing up.\n\nNight 6 — Quiet. I did not sleep.\n\nNight 7 — All three of us dreamt the same dream. We did not agree to write this down. We are writing it down.\n\nNight 8 — Quiet.\n\nNight 9 — New boy asked whether it's the jungle doing it to us, or us doing it to ourselves out here with nothing to look at but the green.\n\nI told him that was the first sensible question anyone has asked at this post.\n\nI did not tell him that I have been here nine years and I still do not know the answer, and that the not knowing is the part that wears you through.",
